ude:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Implants"},{"text":"Metallic objects"},{"text":"Medical devices"},{"text":"Pregnancy screening"},{"text":"Previous surgeries"},{"text":"Claustrophobia"},{"text":"Monitoring requirements"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Project 5 — PACS Workflow"},{"type":"p","text":"Document:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Patient Registration","RIS Order","Imaging Acquisition","Image Reconstruction","PACS Upload","Radiologist Reporting","Electronic Record"]}]},{"heading":"Skill Matrix","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Skill","Importance"],"rows":[[{"text":"Human Anatomy"},{"text":"★★★★★"}],[{"text":"CT Technology"},{"text":"★★★★★"}],[{"text":"MRI Technology"},{"text":"★★★★★"}],[{"text":"Patient Positioning"},{"text":"★★★★★"}],[{"text":"MRI Safety"},{"text":"★★★★★"}],[{"text":"Radiation Safety"},{"text":"★★★★★"}],[{"text":"CT Protocols"},{"text":"★★★★★"}],[{"text":"MRI Sequences"},{"text":"★★★★★"}],[{"text":"Image Quality"},{"text":"★★★★★"}],[{"text":"Patient Communication"},{"text":"★★★★☆"}],[{"text":"Contrast Procedures"},{"text":"★★★★☆"}],[{"text":"PACS/RIS"},{"text":"★★★★☆"}],[{"text":"Infection Control"},{"text":"★★★★☆"}],[{"text":"Emergency Response"},{"text":"★★★★☆"}],[{"text":"Documentation"},{"text":"★★★★☆"}],[{"text":"Basic Medical Terminology"},{"text":"★★★★☆"}]]}]},{"heading":"Digital & Software Skills","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"A modern imaging technologist should understand:"},{"type":"h","text":"Hospital systems"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"PACS"},{"text":"RIS"},{"text":"HIS"},{"text":"EMR/EHR"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Imaging technologies"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"DICOM"},{"text":"Image reconstruction"},{"text":"3D visualization"},{"text":"MPR"},{"text":"MIP"},{"text":"Volume rendering"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Data skills"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Excel"},{"text":"Basic statistics"},{"text":"Quality dashboards"},{"text":"Imaging QA documentation"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Emerging syst